{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:12 2026-08-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:12 2026-08-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:12 2026-08-01 HKT</p><p>今日(8月1日)早上10時31分，西半山列堤頓道36號一住宅單位，保安員報案指一名年約40多歲男住客暈倒屋內，救護員接報到場，經檢驗證實男事主當場不治，警員正調查事件，死者遺體稍後由仵工舁送殮房，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4431529081e8d13e8f22e6e6ae050690/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-01_at_12_03_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2234d464f69654992faaad17e71a7ea2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-01_at_12_03_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a489309ad049bf3498f6e1969be5a465/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-01_at_12_03_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到大廈內調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7968f7d4356ba940578df830faac98c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-01_at_12_03_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到現場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/95eb850515ed7aa7a67a66095e6a247c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-01_at_12_03_02.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T08:02:05.153175+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}